# Ford Sierra Mk2 five-door hatchback, 1987-1993.
#
# The 1987 facelift: smoother nose, body-colour grille surround, revised lamps and
# a redesigned dashboard. 4,407 mm long, 1,694 mm wide, 1,407 mm high,
# 2,603 mm wheelbase. 1.6-2.9 petrol and 1.8/2.3 diesel; XR4x4 and Sapphire.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Sierra
#
# Colours: Diamond White, Rosso Red, Strato Silver and Graphite Grey are documented
# Ford colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 350 in total (white 100, red 100, silver 80, grey 70).
#
# Speed 195 km/h; comfort 125/518 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1987-1993 with a road tail to about 2001.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/ford-sierra-mk2.blend. References:
# citycars/references/ford-sierra-mk2/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

